WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:11.820
56. Bats and bees are dying. One can sting. One lives in dark caves and reminds us of

2
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:18.620
Dracula. So why should we care if bats and bees are dying? There are lots of reasons,

3
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:25.140
actually. Bees pollinate crops. Without enough bees, crops may be less productive, and our

4
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:31.580
food supply may be threatened. Bats, on the other hand, eat insects. They keep down pest

5
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:38.700
levels. Without bats to eat pests, we may face a world full of mosquitoes and other harmful bugs.

6
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:45.100
Scientists know that bees and bats are important, which is why they're trying to figure out what's

7
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:52.140
wrong with them. So far, however, the problems remain mysterious. We still don't know the cause

8
00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:59.020
of colony collapse disorder, in which bees from a colony simply disappear. This phenomenon is

9
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:05.900
happening all over the world now. It may be caused by pesticides or malnutrition. It may be related

10
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:12.540
to new human technologies like cell phones and genetically modified crops. We must remember how

11
00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:19.500
our actions can affect the creatures around us, and how their actions can affect us. The death of

12
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:27.100
bats is also troubling. Bats are developing white nose syndrome, in which a white fungus grows around

13
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:33.900
sick bats' noses. However, the fungus may only be a sign of the real problem, not the cause of the

14
00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:40.380
problem. For some reason, bats are starving to death. What we don't know yet is whether they

15
00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:46.060
don't have food, can't find their food, or are being stressed to death for some other reason.

16
00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:53.820
We truly are connected to every other living thing on Earth. Bats protect us and our food from bugs.

17
00:01:54.380 --> 00:02:00.460
Bees help our crops flourish. Cute, cuddly animals are not the only ones that are important.

18
00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:06.860
All animals deserve respect, and we create problems for ourselves when we forget that.
